"P1354207847" "(The first book of Trilogy opens to a random page) {HeroName} was simple folk, leading a simple life. {hero.gender=male He|She} worked on a farm with their family their entire life. They knew nothing outside the valley they grew up in, occasionally a salesman would come to town with stories of the big cities and their super powered beings saving the day or causing havoc. {HeroName} harbored a secret. {hero.gender=male He|She} had powers too, but there was really no good use for them out here in the valley. So {HeroName} continued to toil about the farm, secretly wanted to be a character in the stories told by those salesmen, but here in the valley no day ever needed to be saved."
// AcceptString :
"P3056438699" "Turn the page of chapter 1 in the first book."
// SendOffString :
"P980967413" "But today. Today was destined to be something different. {HeroName}'s father had tasked {hero.gender=male him|her} with gathering the tools left out in the fields from the day's work before nightfall came. Little did they know that finally a day that needed to be saved would come to the valley."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2262369616" "Save the day"
