// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4252840331" "Dealing with the invading robots, {HeroName} stood perplexed. Why had they come to the valley? What were they after? And who was going to clean up the fields now that there were robot parts all over them?! {HeroName} hoped it wouldn't be {hero.gender=male him|her}."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissionStartJump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page 1 Text :
"P2011691640" "The old man gathered his wits and spoke, 'Hello, there. You're {HeroName} aren't you? My name is Epoch, and I've been wondering when our paths would finally meet. My frail body is happy that today was such a day!'"
// Answer Text :
"P4012691637" "''I am {HeroName} and I am here to rescue you.'"
// Answer Text :
"P1776861788" "{Hero.Gender=Male He|She} stood proudly over the defeated enemies, 'You OK, old man?'"
// Answer Text :
"P2730503519" "{Hero.Gender=Male He|She} looked bewildered, was the old man following {hero.gender=male him|her}?"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page 2 Text :
"P3290372786" "Epoch spoke, 'And for the rescue, I thank you. Now, what do you know about these robots?'"
// Answer Text :
"P2382476617" "{Hero.Gender=Male He|She} recited the story of how they came to {hero.gender=male his|her} farm one afternoon."
// Answer Text :
"P2413283860" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} said, 'Not much. I never would have found this place without this message I received.'"
// Page 3 Text :
"P3273039595" "Epoch answered, 'I am more than alright, {HeroName}. Now that you are here anyway.'"
// Answer Text :
"P3447160622" "'How do you know me?' {Hero.Gender=Male he| she} asked. "
// Answer Text :
"P4067772395" "'You know who I am?' {Hero.Gender=Male he| she} asked. "
// Page 4 Text :
"P1071926867" "Epoch spoke before {HeroName} could, 'Yes, I have been following your efforts. I see you got my message that betrayed the location of this lab. Now, shall we take care of business?'"
// Answer Text :
"P967550365" "Finally {hero.gender=male he|she} had an ally in the fight against the robots."
// Page 5 Text :
"P1284868152" "Epoch said, 'Much as I have gathered as well. I can tell that your timely rescue was born of the information I left you on the location of this place. Now, with that taken care of, shall we get down to business?'"
// Page 6 Text :
"P1771684714" "Epoch smiled. 'You're welcome for that,' and he took a deep bow. Now, shall we take care of business?'"
// Page 7 Text :
"P995479626" "Epoch smiled 'Of course I do. Who do you think gave you the information you needed to find this place? Now, shall we take care of the business at hand?'""

