"P4129212872" "The man known as Epoch seems to be very frail and elderly, but he assures {HeroName} that he can handle himself in a fight. He has certain... gifts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2198600370" "(The first book of Trilogy opens to a random page) {HeroName} found {hero.gender=male himself|herself} at the entrance of the warehouse on the outskirts of town. This was the last step in their long chain of events to determine who was behind the robot attacks on the valley that seemed to happen more and more often ever since that first fateful day. {HeroName}'s powers had come in very handy for self defense, but now {hero.gender=male he|she} was in the hornet's nest."
// AcceptString :
"P1631296213" "Turn the page"
// SendOffString :
"P1975661096" "That old man was here, too. {HeroName} saw him being dragged in here by a couple of robots. Could the old man have been the one that sent the email that connected the dots between all the clues {HeroName} had gathered? {HeroName} suspected as much and wanted to be certain."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P716966294" "Kick over the hornet's nest"
