"P3330416745" "{HeroName} and Epoch escaped the warehouse with their lives. Epoch's knowledge of the situation would prove to be quite valuable in the future. Epoch and {HeroName} frantically discussed their next move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

