// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EpochStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ESPage1 Text :
"P1437240214" "Epoch steeled himself. 'We must be ready for anything. Those robots are being controlled by someone, and I am afraid to be right if it is who I think it is,' he said. {HeroName} knew better than to press the issue, so {hero.gender=male he|she} let him continue, 'Any questions before we go in?'"
// Answer Text :
"P167825785" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} looked concerned. 'Are you going to be OK?' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} asked."
// Answer Text :
"P2653719220" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} was confident, 'OK. What's the plan?'"
// Page 2 Text :
"P2917633550" "'Bah!' exclaimed Epoch. 'I can take care of myself, now let's go over the plan one last time.'"
// Answer Text :
"P4251446203" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} listened intently."
// Page 3 Text :
"P97881507" "'There are four computers in there,' began Epoch. 'We need to shut down each one and that will disable the devices set up around the valley. We can't leave even one of them running or we will fail at the task that has been handed to us.' He continued, 'If we run into the leader of the robots, we should do our best to take him down. He may be the key to everything.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - InfinityPlot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1570654466" "Peronnel File"
// DetailString :
"P3530425813" "{HeroName} and Epoch poured over the data. 'Infinity,' said {HeroName}. 'He runs this whole operation.'<br><br>Epoch wanted to say something, but held his tongue. {HeroName} assumed that he was the one defeated earlier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1764066696" "(The first book of Trilogy opens to a random page){HeroName} and Epoch made their way through the lab. They knew that the leader of the robots was overseeing the last part of this operation personally and they could strike a great blow if they could take him out. The robots had succeeded in planting their devices all over the valley, there was no denying that. It was just down to {HeroName} and Epoch to stop them from being activated."
// SendOffString :
"P3781089892" "Their investigation had told them there were four computers that needed to be shut down in order to prevent catastrophe from befalling the valley. Using equal parts force and stealth, Epoch and {HeroName} make their way into the labs where the controls lie."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1110210352" "Save the Valley."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P241350089" "<color deepskyblue>Chapter 22</color>"

