// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4083508245" "{HeroName} and Epoch made their way to the surface, content in knowing that the valley would be at peace again. In the back of their minds they knew that Infinity's escape meant that their days of respite were numbered, and one day, perhaps one day soon, they would be tasked with saving the day again. {HeroName} looked forward to that day, {hero.gender=male he|she} had grown much in {hero.gender=male his|her} adventures with Epoch. Epoch was an excellent mentor, and {HeroName} hoped they could fight alongside one another forever. <br><br>The End(?)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissionStartJump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EpochStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ESPage1 Text :
"P2585081939" "'It was quite a shock to see those robots strike back so soon,' said Epoch. 'If we act quickly we should be able to stop them with less effort this time.'"
// Answer Text :
"P1928130055" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} agreed, but in {hero.gender=male his|her} mind {hero.gender=male his|her} knew it couldn't be that easy."
// Answer Text :
"P1990181717" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} said, 'I am kind of getting addicted to the excitement.'"
// Page 2 Text :
"P3140584712" "Epoch could tell that {HeroName} had reservations. He would have to discuss the matter further when things were calmer."
// Answer Text :
"P3123913838" "Done"
// Page 3 Text :
"P907369337" "Epoch frowned at {HeroName}. 'One should not crave danger and excitement. You may get what you wished for, but in spades.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MercenaryDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page 1 Text :
"P3855014091" "The man caught his breath. 'Thank you, kindly {hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I've been busting robots for a couple months now.' He looked the pair up and down and realized something, 'You wouldn't perchance happen to be the ones who shut them down for the past month or so, would ya?'"
// Answer Text :
"P1407938274" "'That was us,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said proudly. It was weird to be recognized."
// Answer Text :
"P2286583823" "'You must have us confused with someone else,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said. '"
// Page 2 Text :
"P2901460302" " 'I am {HeroName}, and my mentor here is Epoch. What was your name?'<br><br>'It's an honor to meet you, {hero.gender=male sir|ma'am},' said the stranger as he extended a hand in thanks. 'You too, Mr. Epoch,' and he shook that hand as well. 'Folks call me Mercenary. I am usually a gun for hire, but taking out these robots is a job I do for free.'"
// Answer Text :
"P4256426649" "Mercenary admitted, 'I'll be honest, it's been tough I bet if I helped you out it would work for the best.'"
// Answer Text :
"P1485556676" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} smiled. 'I bet if we had a third person we could take out the robots even faster.'"
// Page 3 Text :
"P870738989" "{Hero.gender=male He|She} wasn't one to brag about {hero.gender=male his|her} exploits. 'You have a name? I am {HeroName} and this here is Epoch.<br><br>'Well that's no matter if you are or aren't, you saved my skin and now I owe you one,' the man began. 'Name's Mercenary. I usually sell my services to the highest bidder, but the robots... those I take out for free.'"
// Answer Text :
"P1508084999" "Mercenary looked at both of them and admitted, 'I'll be honest. It's been tough going taking out these robots by myself.'"
// Answer Text :
"P1487053329" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} smiled. 'I bet if we had a third person in our group we could take out the robots even faster.'"
// Page 4 Text :
"P3375141765" "And so the story continued. The duo was now a trio, and Infinity and his robots would have even more to be on the watch for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MercStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1011479085" "Mercenary's Story"
// DetailString :
"P1674823666" "The cowboy known as Mercenary seemed to have as big a grudge against the robots as {HeroName} and Epoch. He would be a great asset to the duo in the coming days."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P746333453" "(The second book of Trilogy opens to a random page) {HeroName} and Epoch were stunned that the robots would strike back so soon. It was a small force, easily handled, but they had just saved the valley only a week ago. Where were these robots coming from? The big city? It seemed like a good place to start."
// AcceptString :
"P547371958" "Turn the next page of chapter 2 in the second book."
// SendOffString :
"P4048051384" "As {HeroName} and Epoch made their way into the big city, they realized that there were no people around, only robots milling about. What happened here? Where did the people go. They needed answers and they needed them fast, but had no one to ask. {HeroName} was about to speak when they heard a man's voice bellow out over on another block. Epoch and {HeroName} bolted off in the direction of sounds, in search of more answers."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1926415768" "Locate the source of the disturbance"
// TaskTitle :
"P2016986338" "<color deepskyblue>The Second Book</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1911423099" "<color deepskyblue>Chapter 2</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P847435812" "They ventured forth into the big city, not knowing what to expect."
