// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FreeMercenary 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P996578665" "Mercenary was grateful for the rescue, and it seemed the duo of {HeroName} and Epoch just became a trio, as they added a new ally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2975089848" "And so {HeroName} and Epoch were joined by the rough-around-the-edges Mercenary. Mercenary's reasons for joining them seemed obvious, but in reality he was holding back a key piece of information. One that could possibly be the key to destroying Infinity and the robots once and for all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissionStartJump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EpochStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ESPage1 Text :
"P177572913" "The trio prepared themselves for the battles ahead.<br><br>'With all three of us, this should be a breeze,' said Mercenary.<br><br>'Your cockiness will be your undoing,' replied Epoch.<br><br>'If anyone's not making it out of here, it will be you, old man,' Mercenary said in jest, yet his words rang in {HeroName}'s head as frighteningly prophetic."
// Answer Text :
"P995914108" "'I am ready. Let's go,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P880015635" "'Let's get that inventor and her insane machine,' said Mercenary, and the trio was off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3723549580" "(The second book of Trilogy opens to a random page) Mercenary caught his breath. That last battle had exhausted him but now he needed to regain his strength for the upcoming battle. {HeroName} soldiered on, {hero.gender=male his|her} injuries not limiting them in any way. Epoch had uncovered this lab where the robots were assembling the Fractien Super Weapon using the cypher uncovered by Mercenary two weeks prior. It was very fortunate that the robots hadn't changed their cyphers or the trio would have never uncovered this place."
// AcceptString :
"P570346239" "Turn to the next page of chapter 21 in the second book"
// SendOffString :
"P497639659" "They climbed through smelly sewers and cramped ventilation units until their knees were raw and the sweat poured from their brows. Mercenary cracked wise at one point, pulling out a lighter and imitating an action hero. 'Come out to the coast, we'll get together, have a few laughs.' {HeroName} chuckled at the reference, where Epoch just shhh'ed them both. They were on a clandestine mission, after all. They knew that the main component to the Fractien was in this lab, as was the Fractien's inventor who would need to be defeated if they hoped to prevent the Fractien from simply being rebuilt."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2317771303" "Destroy the Fractien and defeat the inventor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P542328143" "They climbed through smelly sewers and cramped ventillation units until their knees were raw and the sweat poured from their brows. Mercenary cracked wise at one point, pulling out a lighter and imitating an action hero. 'Come out to the coast, we'll get together, have a few laughs.' {HeroName} chuckled at the reference, where Epoch just shhh'ed them both. They were on a clandestine mission, after all. They knew that the main component to the Fractien was in this lab, as was the Fractien's inventor who would need to be defeated if they hoped to prevent the Fractien from simply being rebuilt."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3847556810" "<color deepskyblue>Chapter 21</color>"

