// Page ESPage1 Text :
"P905739751" "'The old man better know what he's doing, he's hard to read even at the best of times,' said Mercenary."
// Answer Text :
"P1525556762" ""'I agree,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} replied."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P16399246" "'Time to go,' urged Mercenary."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2682861664" "(The second book of Trilogy opens to a random page) Mercenary turned to {HeroName} and spoke, 'That old man is going to get us all killed, but he's our best hope for getting out of here alive.' It was true. Epoch had left Mercenary and {HeroName} on their own while he went to distract Infinity.It was a bold plan, but {HeroName} didn't understand how Epoch could face Infinity alone and live."
// AcceptString :
"P3447523298" "Turn to the next page of chapter 24 in the second book."
// SendOffString :
"P1169984211" "'The exit,' said Mercenary. 'we need to get to it, NOW. Hopefully Epoch will meet us there, but I am just not sure how that's supposed to happen.' {HeroName} was worried but tried not to show it. After all {hero.gender=male he|she} and Epoch had been through, {hero.gender=male he|she} wasn't sure how {hero.gender=male he|she}'d be able to go on without him as a mentor. {hero.gender=male He|She} put those thoughts out of {hero.gender=male his|her}  head and concentrated on just one thing: Escape."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2475559891" "Escape the facility"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P58508686" "<color deepskyblue>Chapter 24</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2656506417" "With Epoch off on his own, the heroes had to escape on their own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1775790606" "Do you see, Epoch? You cannot hope to best me, not now, not ever."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P617696689" "I did not come here to best you, Infinity, I came here to stall you."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2425402282" "And in that, I have been successful."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1632645283" "Stall me? Hah! That's the best that you can do, isn't it? Stall your inevitable destruction?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1561238230" "All men must face their doom one day, Infinity. I face mine with a smile. How will you face yours?"
// 2 Actor1 :
"P2947354705" "With a rifle."
// Script Variable ACTOR_1_NAME :
"P3232147825" "Infinity"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P534853849" "NAME"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P337629768" "Give me a hand here, {HeroName}, she won't go quietly!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3731237859" "Alright {HeroName}, we can clean this up if we kill Washington!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - WatchedCutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
