"P2686281453" "Escape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3488718892" "And with that, Epoch sacrificed himself to ensure {HeroName} and Mercenary would make it out alive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P322743610" "Epoch was dead. {HeroName} steeled {hero.gender=male him|her}self for this moment but {hero.gender=male he|she} wasn't sure where to go now. Infinity was still out there, and even though {Hero.gender=male he|she} had Mercenary at {hero.gender=male his|her} side, {hero.gender=male he|she} wasn't sure it would be enough. {hero.gender=male He|She} did revel in the joy that the superweapon was permanently destroyed, and so there would be some respite coming, but considering how quickly Infinity struck back after their last major victory, {HeroName} knew that there would be little in the way of respite."

