// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - RecoverBook 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P924630513" "Determine the robot's Plan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P510181021" "The robots were carrying an old book, obviously taken from Epoch's home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P720016913" "With the book recovered from the robots, {HeroName} had something more to go on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1386149967" "With the valley in flames, {HeroName} was shaken into action. {hero.gender=male He|She} now possessed the book that the robots were taking from Epoch's home, but reading it was something else entirely. What secrets lie within? Why would Infinity want this tome? All of these questions and more raced through {HeroName}'s head, and little did {hero.gender=male he|she} realize that the answers were soon to come."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissionStartJump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EpochStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ESPage1 Text :
"P2447269427" "'I brought you here to learn the truth, {HeroName},' said Mercenary."
// Answer Text :
"P1553849518" "'Tell me now, then!' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} exclaimed."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3591106245" "'I need you to learn this in your own time, come to terms with it,' said Mercenary."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FamilyPhotos 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3304280338" "Family Photos"
// DetailString :
"P557230799" "{HeroName} uncovered family photos of Epoch as a child growing up. There seemed to be another person in the photos, a sibiling from the looks of it. Mercenary looked {HeroName} straight in the eyes and told {hero.gender=male him|her} what he read in Epoch's journal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3566202625" "(The third book of Trilogy opens to a random page) {HeroName} was stunned. He hadn't shown the old book to Mercenary for quite some time as {hero.gender=male he|she} figured he'd have nothing further to offer from it, but nothing could have been further from the truth. Mercenary could actually read the book, understood its words completely and fluently. Mercenary's mother hailed from the foreign land where the language originated, and although it had been many years since he laid eyes upon the language, it came back to him like a rushing river of memories."
// AcceptString :
"P206520284" "Turn the page of chapter 16 in the final book."
// SendOffString :
"P4084769914" "'It's a diary,' said Mercenary.'Epoch's personal one it seems. A journal of him growing up. And here… oh,' Mercenary grew silent. He read to himself, even though {HeroName} pressed him for what he was reading. 'If this is right, the warehouse in town should have the information you need to see,' Mercenary muttered. Something you need to see. Let's go before the robots destroy the evidence you need.' Evidence? Information? {HeroName} was confused and lost, but {hero.gender=male he|she} trusted Mercenary so {hero.gender=male he|she} went along. The answers would be coming soon."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P238736401" "Uncover the secret for yourself."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2657842098" "<color deepskyblue>Chapter 16</color>"

