"P3013736295" "{HeroName} and Mercenary had uncovered a huge secret. Just one question remained: what will become of this new information?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1980962943" "Mercenary looked {HeroName} straight in the eyes. 'That brother, in those photos you recovered... according to Epoch's journal here, that's Infinity. The leader of the robots and the person responsible for all of this mess. I think it's time you and I put an end to all of this. You with me?' he asked. {HeroName} knew what must be done. The final chapter was approaching."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6-7_NW_Trilogy_Task9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissionStartJump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page 1 Text :
"P3761548156" "{HeroName} gazed upon Infinity and met his steely gaze. They knew this would be their last encounter together, it would all end here and now. Infinity gathered his power."
// Answer Text :
"P2270095162" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} didn't give him the chance. {Hero.Gender=male He|She} powered up and took aim."
// Answer Text :
"P1091887664" "'Before this all ends, I need to know one thing: why?'"
// Answer Text :
"P1689190746" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} stood still, he waited for Infinity to make the first move."
// Page 2 Text :
"P3560966842" "Infinity seemed to be caught off-guard, as if he was expecting {HeroName} to be more inquisitive. No matter, the end would come sooner than expected."
// Page 4 Text :
"P231910112" "With neither party in the mood for discourse, Infinity lashed out with fury and anger. The end battle would be here and now."
// Page 5 Text :
"P2252643294" "The air crackled with the precursor to the epic combat that was about to entail."
// Page 3 Text :
"P1746226773" "'Why? Of all the questions, how did I know you would ask that one? Epoch and I were not only brothers, but best friends. Until he had his 'accident'. All that power he gained, and he shared NONE of it! Spent his days practicing and training, learning how to wield that power he gained. What else could I do? I studied. I learned. I learned everything there was to know about mechanics and cybernetics. I pioneered that field! I created these robots simply to mimic what Epoch got for free! I worked for my power, and he... he,' Epoch trailed off speechless."
// Answer Text :
"P3986285870" "'He what?' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} asked."
// Answer Text :
"P3438351492" "'He went on to become something good.'"
// Answer Text :
"P2918118077" "'He was the better of you two.'"
// Page 6 Text :
"P270274211" "Infinity was shocked. He was reaching for the word but it wasn't coming to him. Then he spoke without realizing what he was saying 'He went on to do great things. He was given a gift and he used it for good. I took my power.' Infinity started to get angry. 'I earned my power,' Infinity was very angry now. 'I demand my due respect!' Infinity was yelling now."
// Answer Text :
"P2257772839" "'I've got your respect right here,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said as {hero.gender=male he|she} prepared for combat."
// Answer Text :
"P1963361807" "'The power you assembled is worthy of respect,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said."
// Answer Text :
"P2869546129" "'You think the world owes you respect, when you do not respect the world?' "
// Page 7 Text :
"P528854766" ""'He did, and with power he didn't earn. I took my power. I earned it.' Infinity spat."
// Answer Text :
"P837172604" "'Earned power doesn't make it superior. You killed him out of jealousy,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} spat."
// Answer Text :
"P2401307412" "'You think the world owes you  respect, when you do not respect the world?' "
// Page 8 Text :
"P2374474012" "'Better? Hardly. His power, it wasn't earned. His power was a gift that he never questions,' Infinity frothed. 'My power, that I made myself, should make people respect what I have!'"
// Page 9 Text :
"P2582401011" "'I will kill you out of justice! Prepare to die, Infinity!'<br><br>Infinity brought his entire might to bear."
// Answer Text :
"P1973139548" "Combat"
// Page 10 Text :
"P8221122" "'How you used it, however, is not,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said, unsure of how Infinity would react to that fact.<br><br>'Then the world will respect me! The world, will FEAR me!' Infinity grew in power, there seemed to be little chance of talking any more sense into him."
// Answer Text :
"P1498771374" "'The world will defeat you, and use me as it's weapon!' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said."
// Answer Text :
"P4186975219" "'The world will stand up against you, but they can be on your side,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said calmly."
// Page 11 Text :
"P3683666723" "'You only see destruction and death, when you have power to create and give life,' replied {HeroName}.<br><br>'How do you see me as a creator? How do I give life? I am Infinity! I take lives!' Infinity replied."
// Answer Text :
"P1752027059" "'Then try to take mine!' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} fired, and the fight would soon be on."
// Answer Text :
"P1738715244" "'These robots, did you not bring life to them? Let them be your gift to the world,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} replied."
// Page 13 Text :
"P4136962987" "'And how, pray tell, do you think that is going to happen?'"
// Answer Text :
"P1410299396" "'Use this army of robots you have,' said {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1165172295" "{Hero.Gender=male He|She} spoke truthfully, 'If you try hard enough, the world will come around.'"
// Page 15 Text :
"P4221205679" " 'Program them to make the world a better place. Program them to be a legacy of good for yourself, leave your mark. Show that power earned can be just as benevolent as power granted.'<br><br>'What will become of me then?' asked Infinity"
// Answer Text :
"P701338791" "'Immortality,' {Hero.Gender=male he|she} said."
// Page 17 Text :
"P4121591951" "'I think it will be easier just to destroy that which stands in my way, starting with YOU!'"
// Page 18 Text :
"P2082361931" "'Being a legend as the man who brought a new era of help and aid from your robot servants here,' said {heroname}. 'I know you can do it, you just need to let go of your anger, your jealousy.'<br><br>'For a giant pain in the neck, {HeroName} you do speak truthful words. I will do as you have suggested, but I can not stay to see this through, the temptation to use the robots for personal gain will be too great. I will forever leave this place, but before I do, reprogram my robots to help the city and the valley. They will be my legacy. I thank you, and I say goodbye. I regret what I did to my brother, your mentor. I hope you can forgive me, as I can never forgive myself.'"
// Answer Text :
"P3439352112" "'I will see to it that the world knows who to thank,' and with that Infinity surrendered."
// Answer Text :
"P2894409829" "'Make good with your life. I do not wish to have to harm you should we meet again someday.'"

