"P2865288552" "(The third book of Trilogy opens to a random page) {HeroName} wished Mercenary was at {hero.gender=male his|her} side, but he was busy with his own problems right now. {HeroName} would need to face this final battle as {hero.gender=male he|she} faced the first one, with only {hero.gender=male himself|herself} and {hero.gender=male his|her} super powers at {hero.gender=male his|her} disposal. Would it be enough? {HeroName} was confident that it would be."
// AcceptString :
"P1311314047" "Turn the page of chapter 25 in the final book."
// SendOffString :
"P1446271696" "It was the final confrontation with Infinity, the leader of the robots, brother and murderer of {hero.gender=male his|her} mentor, Epoch. {HeroName} stood at the entrace to the underground lab that Infinity used as a base of operations. This would be it. Infinity would pay for what he did, {HeroName} would see to that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1562353352" "The Final Confrontation"
