// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TalkToInfinity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3765220361" "Infinity was a problem no more. {HeroName} would need to seek out Mercenary and tell him of what had transpired."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1269594374" "And so the sun set on the Valley, safe once again from the forces of Infinity. The days would be brighter, now that the shadow of evil was forever cleansed. Our heroes, Mercenary and {HeroName} looked forward to the coming days. No more evil robots.<br><br>{HeroName} wished Epoch could be here to share in the joy, but that was impossible. {hero.gender=male He|She} knew that Epoch was smiling down upon them from whereever he was though, and that was a comforting thought.<br><br>The End."
